copy e%20cost%20of%20breaking%20a%20line%20at%20that%20point.%20The%20function%20hpack%20measures%20a%20list%20and%20records%20how%20far%20its%20glue%20had%20to%20stretch;%20the%20line%20breaker%20then%20chooses%20the%20set%20of%20breakpoints%20with%20the%20fewest%20demerits%20over%20the%20whole%20paragraph%20rather%20than%20filling%20each%20line%20greedily%20and%20hoping.%0A%0AWhat%20the%20difference%20looks%20like%0A%0AA%20greedy%20filler%20commits%20to%20line%20one%20before%20it%20has%20seen%20line%20four.%20Total-fit%20breaking%20will%20loosen%20an%20early%20line%20by%20a%20hair%20to%20rescue%20a%20later%20one,%20and%20the%20suite%20pins%20that%20behaviour%20by%20enumerating%20every%20possible%20breaking%20of%20a%20short%20paragraph%20and%20checking%20that%20the%20chosen%20one%20has%20the%20lowest%20score.%20See%20the%20line%20breaker%20for%20the%20demerits%20formula,%20which%20is%20%C2%A7859%20of%20tex.web%20transcribed%20rather%20than%20paraphrased.%0A%0ABadness%20says%20how%20hard%20one%20line%20had%20to%20work.%20Demerits%20squares%20it,%20adds%20the%20square%20of%20any%20penalty%20at%20the%20break,%20and%20charges%20extra%20when%20two%20adjacent%20lines%20are%20set%20very%20differently%20%E2%80%94%20which%20is%20why%20a%20tight%20line%20never%20sits%20next%20to%20a%20loose%20one%20in%20well%20set%20text.%0A%0AThe%20pieces,%20and%20who%20owns%20what%0A%0AThe%20layout%20core%20knows%20nothing%20about%20fonts.%20It%20consumes%20a%20small%20measuring%20interface%20and%20produces%20a%20tree%20of%20boxes,%20and%20a%20separate%20step%20flattens%20that%20tree%20into%20a%20flat%20list%20of%20draw%20commands%20with%20absolute%20coordinates.%20Two%20unrelated%20backends%20consume%20those%20commands,%20which%20is%20the%20property%20that%20proves%20the%20geometry%20really%20was%20separated%20from%20the%20drawing.%0A%0A1.%20The%20SVG%20backend%20emits%20real%20glyph%20outlines%20and%20needs%20no%20GPU%20at%20all.%0A2.%20The%20ImDrawList%20backend%20issues%20immediate-mode%20calls%20and%20needs%20a%20window.%0A3.%20Neither%20one%20imports%20the%20other,%20and%20neither%20knows%20what%20a%20penalty%20is.%0A%0ATwelve%20steps,%20in%20order%0A%0AEverything%20between%20the%20source%20file%20and%20the%20screen,%20with%20nothing%20left%20out%20and%20nothing%20done%20twice.%20The%20tenth,%20eleventh%20and%20twelfth%20markers%20are%20here%20on%20purpose:%20a%20list's%20gutter%20is%20sized%20so%20that%20a%20two-digit%20number%20still%20clears%20its%20own%20text,%20and%20a%20demo%20that%20stopped%20at%20nine%20would%20never%20show%20it.%0A%0A1.%20markdown%20turns%20the%20source%20into%20blocks%20and%20keeps%20its%20hands%20off%20the%20page.%0A2.%20Each%20run%20of%20text%20becomes%20characters,%20pair%20kerns%20and%20interword%20glue.%0A3.%20style%20resolves%20a%20face%20and%20a%20size%20into%20one%20font%20key%20per%20run.%0A4.%20fontlib%20reads%20the%20advance%20and%20the%20GPOS%20kern%20of%20every%20pair.%0A5.%20linebreak%20offers%20a%20breakpoint%20at%20each%20position%20the%20rules%20allow.%0A6.%20badness%20scores%20how%20hard%20every%20trial%20line%20would%20have%20to%20work.%0A7.%20The
