copy ts%20the%20glue%20in%20the%20chosen%20lines%20and%20rounds%20once,%20at%20the%20end.%0A9.%20Interline%20glue%20puts%20consecutive%20baselines%20a%20constant%20distance%20apart.%0A10.%20vpack%20stacks%20lines%20and%20blocks%20into%20one%20tall%20vertical%20box.%0A11.%20shipout%20walks%20that%20box%20and%20emits%20absolute%20glyph%20coordinates.%0A12.%20A%20backend%20draws%20them,%20and%20knows%20nothing%20whatever%20about%20steps%201%20to%2011.%0A%0ASome%20of%20it%20is%20deliberately%20missing,%20and%20each%20omission%20has%20a%20reason%20written%20down%20next%20to%20it:%0A%0A%E2%80%A2%20Hyphenation,%20because%20the%20full%20implementation%20is%20about%20a%20thousand%20lines%20and%20contains%20the%20worst%20interaction%20in%20all%20of%20TeX,%20which%20is%20reconstructing%20ligatures%20across%20a%20break.%0A%E2%80%A2%20Page%20breaking,%20because%20this%20is%20one%20continuous%20column%20and%20there%20is%20no%20page%20cost%20function%20to%20minimise.%0A%E2%80%A2%20Bidirectional%20text%20and%20complex%20shaping,%20because%20one%20direction%20is%20enough%20to%20make%20the%20argument%20and%20two%20is%20a%20different%20project.%0A%0AHere%20is%20the%20whole%20of%20the%20interface%20the%20layout%20core%20is%20allowed%20to%20see:%0A%0Aclass%20FontMetrics(Protocol):%0A%20%20%20%20def%20advance(self,%20codepoint:%20int)%20->%20float:%20...%0A%20%20%20%20def%20bbox(self,%20codepoint:%20int)%20->%20GlyphBBox:%20...%0A%20%20%20%20def%20kern(self,%20codepoint:%20int,%20following:%20int)%20->%20float:%20...%0A%0ARounding,%20once%0A%0ATeX%20carries%20every%20length%20as%20an%20integer%20number%20of
